---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Sagging Roof Wake Forest NC | Structural Concerns" description="Sagging or soft spots on your Wake Forest roof? Early inspection protects structural integrity. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Sagging Roof</div>
      <h1>Sagging Roof</h1>
      <p>Visible dips or soft spots can indicate decking or structural issues that need professional evaluation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Sagging may result from water-damaged decking, inadequate support, or long-term overload. We inspect from roof and attic sides and recommend the safest path forward — localized repair or more extensive work.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
